  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNAMI Operational Election Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of this project is to enhance the credibility and transparency of Iraq&#x2019;s electoral process in full accordance with relevant national legal and policy frameworks. The project comes as a direct result of the new UNAMI mandate (SCR 2576) adopted on May 27, 2021, asking UNAMI to monitor the Iraqi elections on October 10, 2021. UNOPS will provide UNAMI with operational support in the field of human resources, security support in close coordination with UNDSS in Iraq, logistics and procurement for the deployment of the UN teams and the launch of the UN strategic messaging campaign, pursuant to SCR 2576, and in compliance with UN procedures, rules and regulations.</narrative>
  </description>
